            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KC24U32D, 1\" Stainless Steel Retro Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful satin stainless steel cone shaped retro cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. The 1 Inch Stainless Steel Retro Cabinet Knob is reminiscent of 50's and 60's and brings this retro flair to decor to any cabinet door, furniture piece, or cabinet drawer. The stainless steel construction allows for years of use while looking great.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KC24-Specification.gif?v=1704354662\" width=\"315\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KC24 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other finishes: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-inch-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc24\"><b>Solid Brass Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KC24U32D Brushed Stainless Steel Retro Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Diameter at Base: 1/2\"</li> -->\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KC24.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KC24 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
